sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B

    A->B: solid, no head
    A-->B: dotted, no head
    A->>B: solid, filled head
    A-->>B: dotted, filled head
    A<<->>B: solid, filled both ends
    A<<-->>B: dotted, filled both ends
    A-xB: solid, cross
    A--xB: dotted, cross
    A-)B: solid, async
    A--)B: dotted, async
    A-|\B: solid, half top
    A-|/B: solid, half bottom
    A-\\B: solid, stick top
    A-//B: solid, stick bottom
    A/|-B: reverse half top
    A\|-B: reverse half bottom
    A//-B: reverse stick top
    A\\-B: reverse stick bottom
